  <header class="chapter__head">
    <span class="chapter__num">04</span>
    <h2 class="chapter__title">About <em>me</em></h2>
    <p class="chapter__lede">Curious woman in tech — driven by the belief that the best systems are built to serve people, not just processes.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p style="font-size: var(--t-md); line-height: var(--lh-loose); color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0 0 var(--s-5);">
        I'm an operations coordinator who sits at the intersection of people, data, and the systems that keep teams running.
        From supporting Sparrow robotic deployments at Amazon Robotics to running enterprise demos at Google DeepMind
        — I specialize in the hands-on, high-stakes work that keeps things on schedule and on target.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: var(--t-md); line-height: var(--lh-loose); color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0;">
        A curious woman in tech with ambitions of working in industries where the technology actually changes lives —
        healthcare, education, climate, public infrastructure. I hold a B.S. in Management Information Systems from
        San Jose State University and I speak six languages.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
